ca Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">奥尔特曼预言 AI 第三阶段：&quot;主动式 AI&quot;将让 Agent 在后台自动干活</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Ideogram 4.0正式开源发布，93亿参数模型位列DesignArena全球第四</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic与美国国家安全局合作，部署Claude Mythos大模型开展网络攻防</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达斥资4亿美元收购初创公司Kumo，强化企业级结构化数据预测能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/208afec42a69aad6cfe14f4b8652419a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达已完成对企业定制化AI初创公司Kumo的收购，交易金额至少为4亿美元。Kumo三位联合创始人——前Airbnb CTO范贾·约西福夫斯基、斯坦福教授尤利·莱斯科夫及前LinkedIn AI负责人海玛·拉格哈万已于今年5月正式入职英伟达。Kumo核心资产为其自主研发的KumoRFM基础模型，该模型专为企业数据仓库中的结构化业务数据设计，擅长处理客户流失、信用违约等预测性任务。KumoRFM结合图形机器学习与合成数据技术，无需额外训练即可实现高效预测，且通过微调可将预测准确率提升约10%。此次收购是英伟达完善全栈AI生态的关键布局，旨在增强其在企业级结构化数据预测领域的技术护城河，为企业客户提供更精准的定制化AI解决方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯发布效率智能体工具集，覆盖20+行业并推出多款Agent产品</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/de254234cffdb24ab855efdaa0f68598.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯于6月5日正式发布“效率智能体工具集”，针对个人、办公及企业三大场景，提供覆盖20多个垂直行业的差异化智能体解决方案。个人端产品包括支持“微信直连”的本地AI助手QClaw、个人知识智能体ima、AI助理元宝及“元宝高考通”咨询师Agent。针对职场人群，腾讯推出“Buddy”家族，包含已迭代43个版本的桌面工作台WorkBuddy、编码智能体CodeBuddy以及创意设计工具Miora与Ardot。面向企业用户，腾讯发布WorkBuddy企业版及办公智能体套件Agent Suite，并升级ClawPro管控平台与ADP4.0开发平台，实现Agent从构建、连接到治理的全生命周期管理。目前，该工具集已在医疗、金融、游戏等行业落地，旨在通过封装腾讯内部实践经验，助力企业构建人机协同的超级团队，推动生产力重塑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">奥尔特曼预言 AI 第三阶段：&quot;主动式 AI&quot;将让 Agent 在后台自动干活</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9af407efd777c8ea7d719a4be0a1cd13.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">奥尔特曼预言 AI 第三阶段：&quot;主动式 AI&quot;将让 Agent 在后台自动干活AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jun 5, 202627在 OpenAI 近期举办的一场企业活动上，公司 CEO 萨姆·奥尔特曼（Sam Altman）首次系统性地提出了 AI 产品发展的三阶段理论，并明确表示，继聊天机器人和 AI 智能体(Agent)之后，行业下一个爆发点将是&quot;主动式 AI(Proactive AI)&quot;——一种能够在后台持续运行、主动为用户提供帮助的 AI 系统。奥尔特曼将当前 AI 产品的演进划分为三个清晰阶段。第一阶段是以 ChatGPT 为代表的聊天机器人，用户需要主动发起对话才能获得回应。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Ideogram 4.0正式开源发布，93亿参数模型位列DesignArena全球第四</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/eeb08c88bef20444f5712641bae53d9b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Ideogram于6月3日正式开源发布文生图模型Ideogram 4.0，该模型参数规模达93亿（9.3B），在DesignArena榜单中位列全球第四。技术架构上，Ideogram 4.0采用单流（Single-Stream）设计，由Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct文本编码器、34层可训练扩散Transformer（DiT）、Euler Flow Matching采样器及冻结的KL自动编码器组成，实现了文本与图像Token的联合建模。该模型核心优势在于极强的文字渲染与版式控制能力，通过引入对象与文本边界框（Bounding Box）及结构化JSON字幕数据训练，用户可精准控制图像元素空间关系与排版结构。相比传统模型，Ideogram 4.0在长文本生成准确性上表现显著，适用于海报设计、商业展示及品牌营</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic与美国国家安全局合作，部署Claude Mythos大模型开展网络攻防</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/008796e3ace60d3e601fc0d626b0b325.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic近日与美国国家安全局达成深度合作，协助其部署高性能Claude Mythos大模型用于进攻性网络作战。Anthropic已向国安局派驻六名工程师进行驻场支持，负责模型落地与深度定制。Claude Mythos具备自主发现并利用软件漏洞的能力，今年4月首发后，本周已授权拓展至全球15个国家的150家机构。面对技术滥用质疑，Anthropic内部人士称此举旨在抢占地缘战略先机。与此同时，Anthropic正因拒绝将Claude系列模型用于大规模监控及致命自主无人机研发，与美国国防部陷入司法诉讼，并被列入供应链风险清单。尽管面临合规压力与法律纠纷，Anthropic仍加速商业化布局，正筹备IPO，目标估值突破1万亿美元，凸显AI在国家安全层面的战略价值。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
